    ('WRR414H1', 'Writing for Social Change', '36S', 'We will read and write a variety of texts focused on understanding and effecting social change. Students will be encouraged to engage with different theories of social change and an array of writing genres, ranging from journalism to critical theory to fiction. Ultimately, students will focus on one or several key social issues that they wish to write about for their final project.', null, 1, '{"operator": "AND", "items": [{"credits": 4.0, "department": null}]}'::jsonb)
